msgstr "链式形式 ``mesh.register_point_data(...)`` 会返回该网格，这在保存前逐步构建结果时很方便。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:222 21fe4fdc33594f71adf570948341eb5e
msgid "Per-element fields work the same way, keyed by element type:"
msgstr "逐单元字段的工作方式相同，以单元类型为键："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:230 d27956a17f1443da817de5cc115511e4
msgid ""
"The lower-level :attr:`~tensormesh.Mesh.cells`, "
":attr:`~tensormesh.Mesh.point_data`, :attr:`~tensormesh.Mesh.cell_data` are "
"full :class:`~tensormesh.nn.BufferDict` objects — you can read them with "
