" 都是完整的 :class:`~tensormesh.nn.BufferDict` 对象 —— 你可以用 ``[...]`` 读取它们、遍历它们，或用 "
"``.to(device)`` 移动它们。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:237 3a48136af0f2415f89d5817893e8db4e
msgid "Boundary identification"
msgstr "边界识别"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:239 053fb294edf24c3388f3d801a819aab5
msgid ""
"The generators all populate ``point_data[\"is_boundary\"]`` (a bool tensor "
"over points), which the convenience property exposes as:"
msgstr "所有生成器都会填充 ``point_data[\"is_boundary\"]``\\ （一个定义在节点上的布尔张量），便捷属性将其公开为："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:247 8f8abdc7b0c34affa08c0d02a7e7fd4b
msgid ""
"The mask is detected **topologically**: a facet (edge in 2D, face in 3D) is "
"on the boundary iff exactly one cell references it, and every node on such a"
" facet — including the edge nodes of ``triangle6`` / ``quad9`` / ``tetra10``"
" cells — is a boundary node. This is exact for any geometry and any order, "
"whereas a coordinate test like ``r == R`` misses the nodes gmsh places one "
"ulp off a curved boundary (and silently drops their Dirichlet condition). "
"The same detection is available on any mesh, generated or imported:"
msgstr ""
"该掩码通过\\ **拓扑**\\ 方式检测：一个面（2D 中为边，3D 中为面）位于边界上，当且仅当恰好有一个单元引用它，且该面上所有节点——包括 "
"``triangle6`` / ``quad9`` / ``tetra10`` 单元的边节点——均为边界节点。这对任意几何形状和任意阶数都是精确的，而像"
" ``r == R`` 这样的坐标测试则会遗漏 gmsh 放置在弯曲边界一个 ulp "
"之外的节点（并静默丢弃它们的狄利克雷边界条件）。同样的检测机制适用于任何网格，无论是生成还是导入的："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:263 1ae606156c2d48c5aff66a8d9b74e8b9
msgid ""
"Hand-rolled meshes can also store their own mask under either "
"``is_boundary`` or ``boundary_mask`` — the property accepts both and only "
"falls back to the topological detection when neither exists."
msgstr ""
"手动构建的网格也可以将掩码存储在 ``is_boundary`` 或 ``boundary_mask`` "
"下——该属性接受两者，且仅当两者都不存在时才回退到拓扑检测。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:267 430793383467428792414b8875e95939
msgid ""
"**Per-side masks come for free.** The 2-D / 3-D rectangular and cuboidal "
"generators (:meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_rectangle`, "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_rectangle`, "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_L`, :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_cube`, …) also "
"register one ``is_<side>_boundary`` mask per face so you can pin Dirichlet "
"values on a single edge or face without recomputing the geometry:"
msgstr ""
"**逐边掩码免费提供。** 二维 / 三维的矩形和长方体生成器（\\ :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_rectangle`\\ "
"、\\ :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_rectangle`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_L`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_cube`……）还会为每个面注册一个 ``is_<side>_boundary`` "
"掩码，这样你就可以在单条边或单个面上固定狄利克雷值，而无需重新计算几何："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:284 ceaa72055f94459e801ca7c3a4a95310
msgid "Boundary masks on a rectangle mesh — union and per-side"
msgstr "矩形网格上的边界掩码 —— 并集与逐边"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:289 b86900684b2d49a0b39d559bd24ad4d0
msgid ""
"Boundary points on ``Mesh.gen_rectangle(chara_length=0.08)``. Left: the "
"union mask ``mesh.boundary_mask``. Right: the four per-side masks set "
"automatically by the generator, ready to feed into a region-aware "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`."
msgstr ""
"``Mesh.gen_rectangle(chara_length=0.08)`` 上的边界点。左：并集掩码 "
"``mesh.boundary_mask``\\ 。右：由生成器自动设置的四个逐边掩码，可直接送入区域感知的 "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:294 1629fa520f4a4a5d8c0e8c7fcb6af168
msgid ""
"The per-side masks are coordinate predicates *restricted to the boundary "
"nodes*, evaluated with a tolerance proportional to ``chara_length`` rather "
"than an exact comparison. The hollow generators "
"(:meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_rectangle`, "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_circle`, and the 3-D counterparts) "
"additionally register ``is_inner_boundary`` / ``is_outer_boundary`` — the "
"obstacle and the outer frame — which is what a \"flow past a body\" setup "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"各侧的掩码是\\ *限制在边界节点上的*\\ 坐标谓词，以与 ``chara_length`` 成比例的容差进行求值，而非精确比较。空心生成器（\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_rectangle`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_hollow_circle` 及其三维对应方法）额外注册 "
"``is_inner_boundary`` / ``is_outer_boundary``——即障碍物和外框——这正是\"绕流物体\"设置所需的。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:303 6f20e38e86e34c69a624648e62ab4b00
msgid ""
"For curved domains (:meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_circle`, "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_sphere`, …) or hand-rolled meshes, derive your "
"own masks from coordinates, intersected with the boundary mask so that a "
"tolerance can be used safely, and store them as additional ``point_data`` "
"entries:"
msgstr ""
"对于弯曲域（\\ :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_circle`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.gen_sphere`\\ "
"、…）或手动构建的网格，从坐标派生你自己的掩码，并与边界掩码取交集，以便安全地使用容差，然后将其存储为额外的 ``point_data`` 条目："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:318 5eebb40d2ca048548bf5fb7ceb6fe76a
msgid ""
"These plug straight into a :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` for non-"
"homogeneous Dirichlet BCs (see :doc:`boundary_conditions`)."
msgstr ""
"这些可以直接接入 :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`\\ ，用于非齐次狄利克雷边界条件（参见 "
":doc:`boundary_conditions`\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:325 f489419bb19c4dbda4995a9a3e52a4d3
msgid "I/O — loading and saving"
msgstr "I/O —— 加载与保存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:327 99e8d855a44a47668e7ed7a5773ac43a
msgid ""
"TensorMesh round-trips through `meshio "
"<https://github.com/nschloe/meshio>`_, so any format meshio understands "
"(``.msh``, ``.vtk``, ``.vtu``, ``.xdmf``, ``.obj``, …) is fair game."
msgstr ""
"TensorMesh 通过 `meshio <https://github.com/nschloe/meshio>`_ 进行往返读写，因此 meshio"
" 能识别的任何格式（\\ ``.msh``\\ 、\\ ``.vtk``\\ 、\\ ``.vtu``\\ 、\\ ``.xdmf``\\ 、\\ "
"``.obj``……）都可使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:331 524accce3b9d4f9982e9544acd010849
msgid "**Loading.** From a path:"
msgstr "**加载。** 从路径加载："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:337 1f995ff355d0454285ffad4f4ecc132b
msgid "Or from an in-memory meshio object:"
msgstr "或从内存中的 meshio 对象加载："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:345 8e996a21e30b4fb3bf8ac05d82c6ff14
msgid ""
"The ``reorder=True`` flag is **required when ingesting Gmsh or VTK** data: "
"those formats use a different node-ordering convention for quads, hexes, and"
" high-order elements than TensorMesh's internal lexicographic layout. "
"Skipping it produces a valid-looking mesh whose geometry map is wrong — "
"every result downstream is silently wrong. For cells of order 2 and above "
"the constructor now catches this "
"(:meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.check_node_ordering`: every edge node must sit "
"nearest to its own edge) and raises ``ValueError`` telling you to pass "
"``reorder=True``; *linear* quads and hexes carry no edge nodes, so a mis-"
"ordered linear quad/hex mesh still goes undetected — pass the flag. The "
"built-in generators already handle this, so you only need ``reorder=True`` "
"on external files."
msgstr ""
"``reorder=True`` 标志在\\ **导入 Gmsh 或 VTK 数据时是必需的**\\ "
"：这些格式对四边形、六面体和高阶单元使用的节点排序约定与 TensorMesh "
"内部的字典序布局不同。跳过此标志会产生一个看起来有效但几何映射错误的网格——下游所有结果都会静默出错。对于 2 "
"阶及以上的单元，构造函数现在会捕获此问题（\\ :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.check_node_ordering`\\ "
"：每个边节点必须位于其自身边附近）并引发 ``ValueError``\\ ，提示你传入 ``reorder=True``\\ ；\\ *线性*\\ "
"四边形和六面体没有边节点，因此排序错误的线性四边形/六面体网格仍然无法被检测到——请传入该标志。内置生成器已自动处理此问题，因此你只需在外部文件上使用 "
"``reorder=True``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:358 8d01b6295df740bb9152f2ad00735a86
msgid ""
"For a side-by-side visual of the two conventions — TensorMesh's internal "
"numbering on top, Gmsh / VTK on the bottom, for triangles, quads, tets, and "
"hexes at orders 2–4 — see :ref:`node-ordering-gallery`. That gallery is the "
"easiest way to verify which convention a hand-rolled connectivity array is "
"using."
msgstr ""
"如需并排查看这两种约定 —— 上方为 TensorMesh 的内部编号，下方为 Gmsh / VTK，涵盖 2–4 阶的三角形、四边形、四面体和六面体 "
"—— 请参见 :ref:`node-ordering-gallery`\\ 。该画廊是验证手工构建的连接性数组使用的是哪种约定的最简便方法。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:364 a7f343a32edb42e9ab099801080a5e45
msgid "**Saving.** Whatever format meshio writes:"
msgstr "**保存。** 凡是 meshio 能写出的格式皆可："

#: ../../source/user_guide/meshes.rst:371 415d7b122f9c437cb42a0df4af23a51e
msgid ""
"For ``.vtk`` and ``.vtu`` outputs, ``save`` automatically reorders back to "
"VTK convention and pads 2D coordinates to 3D — no flag needed. Such a file "
"is therefore a regular VTK file: read it back with ``reorder=True`` like any"
" other external mesh. The lower-level :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.to_meshio` "
"returns the meshio object directly if you need custom write logic."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``.vtk`` 和 ``.vtu`` 输出，\\ ``save`` 会自动重新排序回 VTK 约定，并将 2D 坐标填充为 "
"3D——无需任何标志。因此该文件是一个标准的 VTK 文件：像读取任何其他外部网格一样，使用 ``reorder=True`` 读回。底层的 "
":meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.to_meshio` 直接返回 meshio 对象，以便你需要自定义写入逻辑时使用。"

